{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Keyboard Wizards</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Type. Cast. Conquer!</strong></h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Keyboard Wizards</strong> is a fast-paced, magic-infused card battler where every spell is cast by your typing skill! Build your spell deck, unleash powerful magic, and test your reflexes in battles inspired by Philippine folklore.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Become the best Keyboard Wizard!</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Unique Typing Combat:</strong> Cast spells and attack enemies by typing magic incantations\u2014speed and accuracy mean victory!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338850/extras/SpellFight.gif?t=1747995434\" /><br></li><li><strong>Build Your Spell Deck:</strong> Collect and customize spell cards, discover powerful combos, and create your winning strategy.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338850/extras/CardDeck.png?t=1747995434\" /><br></li><li><strong>Epic Fantasy Battles:</strong> Duel deadly AI opponents in magical arenas inspired by creatures and legends from the Philippines.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338850/extras/FightMonsters.gif?t=1747995434\" /><br></li><li><strong>Status Effects &amp; Strategy:</strong> Heal, Stun, shield, or outwit your foes\u2014timing your typing can mean the difference between victory and defeat!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338850/extras/SupportSpell.png?t=1747995434\" /><br></li><li><strong>Fantasy Narrative or PvP Combat:</strong> Live the story of a new student to SIERRA ENCANTADA INSTITUTE of MAGICAL STUDIES as they rise to become the top wizard\u2014or dominate PvP combat with your typing skills!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:/